---

This report details the development and optimization of high aspect ratio Deep Reactive Ion Etching (DRIE) using the Bosch process. The objective of this project is to refine etching parameters to achieve aspect ratios between 50:1 and 100:1, pushing the boundaries of current etching capabilities.